  "caption": "The same hotel room. The same dates. A different price.\n\nHere's why: the big booking sites charge hotels 15 to 25% commission, and that cost lands in the price you pay. We buy at net rates from 280+ suppliers and add a flat 10%. That's the whole trick.\n\nOn average, that makes us 18% cheaper.*\n\nSave this for your next trip and compare before you book. Link in bio.\n\n*Average across our price checks vs major booking sites. Not every hotel, every date.\n\n#hotelbooking #traveltips #travelhacks",
